# Reliaburger

> Reliaburger is an orchestrator. Its CLI is `relish`.

- **Run `relish agent guide` first.**

## Start here

- [Working with an AI agent](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reliaburger/reliaburger/v0.2.7/docs/manual/16_working-with-an-ai-agent.md): the agent chapter; `relish agent guide` prints the copy that matches your installed `relish`

## Manual

- [Getting started](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reliaburger/reliaburger/v0.2.7/docs/manual/00_getting-started.md)

## Optional

- [Building Reliaburger](https://github.com/reliaburger/reliaburger/tree/v0.2.7/docs/book): the book, how and why each part was built
- [Design documents](https://github.com/reliaburger/reliaburger/tree/v0.2.7/docs/design): one per subsystem
- [Whitepaper](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reliaburger/reliaburger/v0.2.7/docs/whitepaper.md): the architecture in one document
